              "text": "सकणो (sakṇo) is a tadbhava, a word inherited from Sanskrit and reshaped by sound change. It comes from śaknoti, \"is able\". CDIAL gives no Marwari form in this entry (CDIAL 12252); the match is through Old Gujarati sakaï."
